#: src/routes/HowToPlay.tsx:2585
msgid "Fish are a <0>side currency</0>: they don't count toward the hand limit and can't be stolen, discarded or <1>traded</1>, whether to the bank or to another player, by the robber, the pirate, a knight or Monopoly. You spend <2>whole tiles</2> and can't make change; overpayment is lost."
