#: src/routes/HowToPlay.tsx:2166
msgid "On a 7, count your <0>resources and commodities together</0> against the <1>limit of 7</1>. If the combined total is over it, discard <2>half the combined total</2> (rounded down), paid from either pool in any mix you like. City walls raise your own limit; see below."
